{
  "name": "每日AI新闻综述生成器",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 20 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "bed45009-2ac5-4027-8730-d27c3b01d4a2",
      "name": "Daily 8PM Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "tableId": "ai_articles",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "created_at",
              "keyValue": "gte.{{ $('Set Dates').item.json.lastweekDate }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "created_at",
              "keyValue": "lt.{{ $moment($('Set Dates').item.json.currentDate).add(1, 'day').format('YYYY-MM-DD') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1b5a2f61-79ab-419e-8017-86f462c079a0",
      "name": "Get Today's AI Articles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "mnS6q7Jby2UblcPc",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-articles-exist",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b651d8e9-2e11-4973-8ca0-ad35cd466c2f",
      "name": "Check Articles Available",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=你是一个专业的新闻编辑，需要从以下AI新闻文章中评估新闻价值并选择最重要的5篇。\n\n评估标准：\n1. 新闻的重要性和影响力\n2. 技术创新程度\n3. 行业影响范围\n4. 时效性和热度\n5. 对读者的价值\n\n请分析以下文章列表，为每篇文章打分（1-10分），并选择得分最高的5篇文章。\n\n文章列表：\n{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }}\n\n请按以下JSON格式返回结果：\n{\n  \"selected_articles\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"文章ID\",\n      \"title\": \"文章标题\",\n      \"score\": 评分,\n      \"reason\": \"选择理由\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n只返回JSON格式，不要其他内容。",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "04929849-d35c-473d-b520-11c6134a6e14",
      "name": "Evaluate News Value",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        640,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0889b038-c06c-4498-9187-a0472e810012",
      "name": "OpenAI Evaluator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "P5bLdiURYlpp7QED",
          "name": "n8n free OpenAI API credits"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * 解析AI评估结果并获取选中的文章详细信息\n * @returns {Array} 包含选中文章详细信息的数组\n */\nfunction processSelectedArticles() {\n  const evaluationResult = JSON.parse($json.text);\n  const selectedArticles = evaluationResult.selected_articles;\n  const allArticles = $('Get Today\\'s AI Articles').all();\n  \n  // 根据选中的ID获取完整的文章信息\n  const detailedArticles = selectedArticles.map(selected => {\n    const fullArticle = allArticles.find(article => \n      article.json.id === selected.id\n    );\n    \n    return {\n      ...fullArticle.json,\n      evaluation_score: selected.score,\n      selection_reason: selected.reason\n    };\n  });\n  \n  return detailedArticles;\n}\n\nreturn processSelectedArticles();"
      },
      "id": "c2bfcd87-fa68-4088-8753-48f863eceb8e",
      "name": "Process Selected Articles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=你是一位专业的科技新闻编辑，需要基于今天最重要的5篇AI新闻撰写一篇综述风格的文章。\n\n文章要求：\n1. 使用Markdown格式\n2. 包含引人入胜的标题\n3. 开头提供今日AI新闻要点总结（TL;DR）\n4. 按主题或重要性组织内容\n5. 每个新闻都要有简洁的分析和见解\n6. 结尾提供趋势分析和未来展望\n7. 保持客观、专业的新闻写作风格\n8. 字数控制在1500-2000字\n\n今日精选的5篇AI新闻：\n{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }}\n\n请撰写一篇高质量的AI新闻综述文章。文章应该：\n- 以## 开头作为主标题\n- 使用### 作为各个部分的小标题\n- 在文章开头包含**TL;DR**部分\n- 为每篇新闻提供深度分析\n- 在结尾提供行业趋势洞察\n\n开始撰写文章：",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "5bdf490e-d4de-4586-83e0-ee4eac819dc5",
      "name": "Generate Summary Article",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        1160,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
